msgid "Jumper T16 Pro Transmitter"
msgstr "Jumper T16 Pro 遥控器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-jumperT16pro.rst:11
#: dbb1bd3eadef4d78a3738bb405e18376
msgid ""
"Jumper T16 PRO is a stand-alone transmitter compatible with many other RC "
"systems and utilizes an OpenTX firmware branch like FrSky. This means that "
"it has the telemetry display capabilities of the FrSky transmitters when "
"used with FrSky D and X series receivers, but can also be used with many "
"other receivers, for those that have multiple system types."
msgstr ""
"Jumper T16 PRO 是一款独立遥控器，兼容多种 RC 系统，使用与 FrSky 类似的 OpenTX 固件分支。这意味着当与 FrSky D "
"和 X 系列接收机配合使用时，它具有 FrSky 遥控器的数传显示能力，同时也可与多种其他接收机配合使用，适合拥有多种系统类型的用户。"

